# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:89
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_50b7c679:

    # "The mini-game has two phases, attack and defend."
    "小游戏分为两个阶段，攻击和防守。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:90
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_f4072a77:

    # "When it's your turn to attack you, will see four directional arrows on the screen with four different options."
    "当轮到你攻击时，屏幕上会出现四个方向箭头，对应四个不同选项。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:91
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_4660500e:

    # "Select one option using the arrow keys on your keyboard..."
    "用键盘上的方向键选择一个选项..."

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:92
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_e10eadc4:

    # "...but be quick or you will fail your attack."
    "但要快，否则你的攻击会失败。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:96
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_4508a74d:

    # "After selecting an attack, you need to enter the combination that pops up on the screen using the arrow keys."
    "选择完攻击后，你需要用方向键输入屏幕上弹出的组合。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:97
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_bb952bd6:

    # "If you enter the correct combination and are quick enough, you will successfully attack your opponent."
    "如果你输入正确的组合并且反应够快，就能成功攻击对手。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:98
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_7ba3be26:

    # "If you press the wrong key, or if you take too long trying to enter the combination, you will fail your attack."
    "如果你按错了键，或者花太长时间输入组合，你的攻击就会失败。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:99
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_12a85e88:

    # "When it's your turn to defend you will, once again, have to enter a combination that pops up on the screen."
    "当轮到你防守时，你又得输入屏幕上出现的组合。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:100
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_c8c45dc1:

    # "If you succeed, you will defend the attack. Otherwise, you will get hit and lose some HP."
    "如果你成功了，你就能抵挡攻击。否则的话，你就会被击中并失去一些HP。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:104
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_b7ca86d2:

    # "When you're attacking, you want to look out for certain keywords and avoid others."
    "攻击时要留意一些关键词，避开其他词。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:105
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_c7c712f5:

    # "You can buy skills and skill points in the \"Store\". Don't forget to allocate your skill points in the \"Skills\" menu."
    "你可以在“商店”里购买技能和技能点，别忘了在“技能”菜单里分配你的技能点。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:106
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_aa248d3e:

    # "You can also change your Skill point allocation in the \"Skills\" menu and try different combinations."
    "你也可以在“技能”菜单中调整技能点分配，尝试不同的组合。"

# new_phone\apps\brawler\brawler.rpy:107
translate schinese sports101_tutorial_becf78a5:

    # "Beat different opponents to get different rewards."
    "击败不同对手获得不同奖励。"

